2. Update Makevars, leafblower.h (enum, lbfgs_m, params size), types.hpp
3. c_api.cpp: remove #include, pack_lbfgsb_result, lbfgs_m, dispatch; replace fallback with newton block
4. r_bridge.cpp: same; set kAlgNames[2]=""; replace fallback with newton block
5. R CMD INSTALL --preclean . 2>&1 | grep 'error:\|EXPECTED_RK'
6. Fix EXPECTED_RK_PARAMS_BYTES from compile output
7. Rebuild until clean
8. Smoke: Rscript -e 'library(leafblower); r=harvest(data.frame(a=factor(c("x","y","x")),b=factor(c("p","q","p"))), list(a=c(x=0.6,y=0.4),b=c(p=0.7,q=0.3))); cat("ok\n")'
9. Commit: 'remove(lbfgsb): delete C++ solver, strip dispatch, replace AUTO fallback with newton_kl'

