**Forbidden:** Editing K-2's Algorithm 1 baseline (regression risk); adding cell compression (lands K-4); editing src/r_bridge.cpp / R/harvest.R; tuning hyperparameters beyond Chambolle-Pock spec; warm-start; predictor-corrector.
