| **Format** | All state in `double`. std::vector / Eigen — no raw new/delete. Step-size invariant σ_k τ_k ‖A‖² ≤ 1 maintained algebraically (no runtime check). PROTECT/UNPROTECT unchanged (no new SEXP slots in K-3 — slots 37-45 already declared in K-1). |
